1
00:00:01,250 --> 00:00:02,710
[♪ tense music playing]

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:06,330
I...

3
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:10,250
I...

4
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:13,420
I...

5
00:00:14,330 --> 00:00:15,170
[gasps]

6
00:00:16,710 --> 00:00:17,540
[LISA] Lara.

7
00:00:19,290 --> 00:00:20,130
[LARA] Big sis.

8
00:00:21,290 --> 00:00:22,130
Why?

9
00:00:22,710 --> 00:00:23,540
I don't...

10
00:00:24,210 --> 00:00:25,040
It's okay.

11
00:00:25,670 --> 00:00:27,040
Don't worry, you're safe now.

12
00:00:27,790 --> 00:00:30,210
When I saw it moving,
I knew something was wrong,

13
00:00:30,290 --> 00:00:32,080
so I came for you
as fast as I could.

14
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:36,000
[ominous rumbling]

15
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:44,540
Lara, listen to me.

16
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:47,330
The witch, she's
coming for you.

17
00:00:47,670 --> 00:00:49,880
[heavy breathing]

18
00:00:51,290 --> 00:00:52,170
[LARA] Lady Witch?

19
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:53,710
What do you mean?

20
00:00:54,330 --> 00:00:56,790
[LISA] She's probably coming
here because she's angry

21
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,750
you couldn't make
her wish come true.

22
00:00:59,960 --> 00:01:02,790
The witch was manipulating you
because she wanted to harness

23
00:01:02,880 --> 00:01:03,880
the light you created

24
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:05,380
and use it for herself.

25
00:01:05,880 --> 00:01:07,920
Once she realized
that wasn't possible,

26
00:01:08,580 --> 00:01:11,920
she saw no need for you
or for any of the mermaids

27
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:13,080
to be here anymore.

28
00:01:13,830 --> 00:01:14,670
But...

29
00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:16,790
She's here!

30
00:01:26,750 --> 00:01:27,580
The witch!

31
00:01:29,040 --> 00:01:29,920
Lara.

32
00:01:30,290 --> 00:01:31,130
[grunts]

33
00:01:36,080 --> 00:01:36,920
Lady Witch!

34
00:01:37,790 --> 00:01:39,920
[♪ dramatic music intensifies]

35
00:01:42,500 --> 00:01:44,330
[both grunting]

36
00:01:54,500 --> 00:01:56,210
[grunts]

37
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:09,040
[♪ dramatic music fades]

38
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:15,500
She had aged so much.

39
00:02:16,540 --> 00:02:18,500
You see now
why she needed your light.

40
00:02:20,880 --> 00:02:22,210
But it's finally over.

41
00:02:24,380 --> 00:02:25,420
The witch is gone.

42
00:02:30,420 --> 00:02:31,250
What?

43
00:02:31,460 --> 00:02:33,210
[Rowan weakly] I can hear...

44
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:36,210
Who is that?

45
00:02:38,330 --> 00:02:40,040
Yeah, I'm right by the bridge.

46
00:02:40,670 --> 00:02:42,460
[siren wailing in background]

47
00:02:43,920 --> 00:02:44,750
[gasps]

48
00:02:53,580 --> 00:02:55,670
[♪ opening music begins]

49
00:04:19,960 --> 00:04:22,000
[♪ opening music ends]

50
00:04:30,830 --> 00:04:31,830
[Rowan sobs]

51
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:32,920
I can't see.

52
00:04:33,290 --> 00:04:34,130
[gasps]

53
00:04:34,540 --> 00:04:35,920
[ROWAN] I can't see a thing.

54
00:04:38,130 --> 00:04:38,960
Where am I?

55
00:04:40,380 --> 00:04:41,250
Lara?

56
00:04:42,670 --> 00:04:43,500
Lara!

57
00:04:44,880 --> 00:04:45,710
[LARA] Father!

58
00:04:50,630 --> 00:04:53,330
THREE DAYS LATER
SEPTEMBER 30TH

59
00:04:53,540 --> 00:04:56,130
[MARI] I can't find Lara or
her older sister anywhere.

60
00:04:56,330 --> 00:04:57,380
[LUCA] I can't either.

61
00:04:57,630 --> 00:05:00,330
Her work said she hasn't shown
up for any of her shifts.

62
00:05:00,460 --> 00:05:02,080
It's like she's just vanished.

63
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:09,040
I guess we should
go to the police.

64
00:05:09,130 --> 00:05:11,130
[MARI] We can't.
What would we tell them?

65
00:05:11,210 --> 00:05:13,170
It's not like Lara
has an ID or anything.

66
00:05:13,380 --> 00:05:15,630
[LUCA] Well, we have to do
something, don't we?

67
00:05:15,710 --> 00:05:16,750
[MARI] I want to, but

68
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:19,830
if Lara can't live here
anymore then what can we do?

69
00:05:20,500 --> 00:05:21,790
I'll find true love

70
00:05:22,380 --> 00:05:24,330
up here on the surface.
I know it.

71
00:05:25,130 --> 00:05:26,500
What are you talking about?

72
00:05:26,880 --> 00:05:29,830
Never mind. We have to think of
somewhere else she might be.

73
00:05:30,630 --> 00:05:32,130
[line buzzing]

74
00:05:43,080 --> 00:05:45,130
[LISA] Father has awoken
from his slumber,

75
00:05:45,250 --> 00:05:46,630
but it won't last long.

76
00:05:47,130 --> 00:05:49,460
The witch's spell has been
broken, and so Father

77
00:05:49,540 --> 00:05:50,830
is coming back to us.

78
00:05:51,380 --> 00:05:52,880
But the light is still lost.

79
00:05:53,830 --> 00:05:55,330
We have to find
a way to restore

80
00:05:55,420 --> 00:05:57,080
the light as soon as possible.

81
00:05:58,460 --> 00:06:00,670
We have to unlock
your power somehow.

82
00:06:05,210 --> 00:06:06,040
[LARA] I can't.

83
00:06:10,250 --> 00:06:11,130
I can't.

84
00:06:15,290 --> 00:06:16,170
I can't.

85
00:06:20,040 --> 00:06:20,880
Mari.

86
00:06:21,960 --> 00:06:22,790
[gasps]

87
00:06:26,380 --> 00:06:27,630
[LISA] You have to let go.

88
00:06:28,080 --> 00:06:30,250
Just forget about
that human, Lara.

89
00:06:32,670 --> 00:06:33,500
Mari!

90
00:06:33,790 --> 00:06:36,670
Our peaches are perfectly ripe.
Lara is staying at her older

91
00:06:36,750 --> 00:06:37,790
sister's place, right?

92
00:06:38,330 --> 00:06:39,540
Send them to her.

93
00:06:41,420 --> 00:06:43,420
I'll see if I can get
in touch with her.

94
00:06:44,460 --> 00:06:45,290
Hmm?

95
00:06:46,080 --> 00:06:48,210
Something's
definitely not right.

96
00:06:57,500 --> 00:06:58,330
Gon-chan.

97
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:01,750
Lara.

98
00:07:04,670 --> 00:07:06,380
You're coming back, aren't you?

99
00:07:10,210 --> 00:07:13,250
OCTOBER 1ST

100
00:07:13,460 --> 00:07:16,000
LARA

101
00:07:28,540 --> 00:07:31,460
OCTOBER 2ND

102
00:07:48,580 --> 00:07:51,170
OCTOBER 3RD

103
00:07:51,330 --> 00:07:52,170
[KOTA] Lady Lisa!

104
00:07:52,540 --> 00:07:53,670
King Rowan is—

105
00:07:56,710 --> 00:07:58,130
[ROWAN] I'm so happy.

106
00:07:59,460 --> 00:08:01,250
The witch's spell is breaking.

107
00:08:01,540 --> 00:08:03,000
Slowly but surely,

108
00:08:03,080 --> 00:08:04,830
I am regaining my sight
and can see

109
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:06,750
my beautiful daughters again.

110
00:08:10,500 --> 00:08:11,420
However...

111
00:08:12,670 --> 00:08:15,830
seeing those hideous legs on my
own daughter is bringing me

112
00:08:15,920 --> 00:08:19,380
immense pain. It's as if
my heart is being torn apart.

113
00:08:26,710 --> 00:08:27,580
I have...

114
00:08:33,380 --> 00:08:34,710
...a favor to ask.

115
00:08:36,420 --> 00:08:38,540
[♪ dramatic music]

116
00:08:42,170 --> 00:08:43,130
[ROWAN] I'm sorry,

117
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:44,830
Lara.

118
00:08:47,500 --> 00:08:48,330
[grunts]

119
00:08:53,040 --> 00:08:53,880
[LARA] I...

120
00:08:54,670 --> 00:08:56,130
[ROWAN] Save your breath.

121
00:08:56,920 --> 00:08:59,830
Words of regret don't suit
a princess like you.

122
00:08:59,920 --> 00:09:01,040
It's beneath you.

123
00:09:01,830 --> 00:09:04,000
A princess must be
a model of pride,

124
00:09:04,080 --> 00:09:06,000
and stand behind her decisions.

125
00:09:06,960 --> 00:09:09,630
Besides, I blame
the humans for this.

126
00:09:10,830 --> 00:09:13,080
They are the reason it turned
out this way.

127
00:09:13,670 --> 00:09:14,500
[gasps]

128
00:09:15,500 --> 00:09:19,750
My castle had begun to lose
its light long ago, way before

129
00:09:19,830 --> 00:09:21,920
you left us for
the surface world.

130
00:09:22,750 --> 00:09:25,920
Because your mother,
my beautiful Rigmor,

131
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:28,580
was killed by those humans.

132
00:09:28,790 --> 00:09:29,630
Huh?

133
00:09:30,920 --> 00:09:35,080
No matter where I go, those
humans stand in my way.

134
00:09:36,130 --> 00:09:39,540
Everywhere they go,
they advance, take over,

135
00:09:39,630 --> 00:09:42,710
plunder, and defile
everything in their path.

136
00:09:44,420 --> 00:09:47,290
All they do is destroy,
above the sea

137
00:09:47,380 --> 00:09:49,630
or within the sacred waters.

138
00:09:50,580 --> 00:09:53,830
Those humans even took
Rigmor from me.

139
00:09:57,880 --> 00:10:00,500
Unlike us who
possess long lives,

140
00:10:00,580 --> 00:10:03,750
human lives are
meager and short.

141
00:10:04,290 --> 00:10:05,130
But...

142
00:10:05,580 --> 00:10:07,380
even if they forget,

143
00:10:08,380 --> 00:10:10,210
us mermaids never will.

144
00:10:11,250 --> 00:10:14,420
We will never, ever forget.

145
00:10:16,710 --> 00:10:17,540
[gasps]

146
00:10:20,920 --> 00:10:21,750
Oh,

147
00:10:22,670 --> 00:10:23,920
so this is

148
00:10:24,380 --> 00:10:26,040
what I was feeling.

149
00:10:27,290 --> 00:10:28,130
Light!

150
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:30,920
Lara,

151
00:10:31,380 --> 00:10:33,080
that must be it.

152
00:10:34,920 --> 00:10:37,380
That is your princess's light.

153
00:10:38,380 --> 00:10:39,540
That is my light?

154
00:10:42,170 --> 00:10:43,170
It can't be.

155
00:10:43,380 --> 00:10:44,540
That's not light at all.

156
00:10:45,460 --> 00:10:47,420
It has done nothing
but bring me pain.

157
00:10:47,830 --> 00:10:49,710
It only seeks to hurt others.

158
00:10:51,540 --> 00:10:53,380
That blade is merely a tool.

159
00:10:53,830 --> 00:10:55,880
It is neither good nor evil.

160
00:10:56,460 --> 00:10:58,670
It's nothing more
than your light

161
00:10:58,750 --> 00:11:00,750
taking on a temporary shape.

162
00:11:01,630 --> 00:11:02,460
Look.

163
00:11:15,830 --> 00:11:19,130
[ROWAN] That power is the true
manifestation of your light.

164
00:11:20,170 --> 00:11:23,960
Your heart wanders searching
for something it cannot find.

165
00:11:24,420 --> 00:11:27,540
That power, with nowhere to
channel itself, is granting

166
00:11:27,630 --> 00:11:30,080
infinite life to your spirit.

167
00:11:31,500 --> 00:11:33,420
This is an incredible power

168
00:11:33,500 --> 00:11:36,130
that humans cannot
possibly understand.

169
00:11:36,500 --> 00:11:40,130
This manifestation of light
is something only we mermaids

170
00:11:40,210 --> 00:11:41,460
are able to see.

171
00:11:43,580 --> 00:11:46,420
This strange situation on
the lake was discovered early

172
00:11:46,500 --> 00:11:48,540
in the morning after
a resident reported it.

173
00:11:48,630 --> 00:11:51,210
There appeared to be white
flower-like objects on

174
00:11:51,290 --> 00:11:52,960
the water around Oki Island.

175
00:11:53,040 --> 00:11:55,460
What the-- What are
those doing there?

176
00:11:56,250 --> 00:11:57,880
-Oki Island.
-Right.

177
00:11:59,040 --> 00:12:00,710
That flower on the news,

178
00:12:01,040 --> 00:12:02,330
I've seen it before.

179
00:12:02,880 --> 00:12:06,080
It's the exact same one that
I saw when Lara disappeared.

180
00:12:09,250 --> 00:12:10,080
[MARI] Lara,

181
00:12:11,670 --> 00:12:13,290
I'm going to find you.

182
00:12:16,170 --> 00:12:17,830
[LUCA] It really is
that flower.

183
00:12:19,460 --> 00:12:20,830
What on earth is going on?

184
00:12:21,920 --> 00:12:24,460
If Lara's there, then we're
going to Oki Island.

185
00:12:27,920 --> 00:12:29,960
WATER QUALITY
MONITORING TANK

186
00:12:30,670 --> 00:12:32,540
[MALE] Huh?
Something's off here.

187
00:12:33,750 --> 00:12:36,000
-[MALE 1] What a strange color.
-[MALE 2] Yeah.

188
00:12:37,790 --> 00:12:39,130
[MARI] Why can't we go out?

189
00:12:39,960 --> 00:12:41,290
[MALE] We don't know either.

190
00:12:41,420 --> 00:12:43,710
We got a call from the
fishing cooperative.

191
00:12:43,790 --> 00:12:46,460
Anyway, it looks like they've
already put up a barrier.

192
00:12:46,540 --> 00:12:47,710
[cellphone rings]

193
00:12:49,500 --> 00:12:51,750
[MALE] What? No
navigation? Huh?

194
00:12:52,080 --> 00:12:53,290
Are you serious?

195
00:12:54,290 --> 00:12:57,290
This morning, an unusual
change in color was observed

196
00:12:57,380 --> 00:13:00,540
across a wide area of
Lake Biwa in Shiga Prefecture.

197
00:13:00,630 --> 00:13:03,670
According to the water bureau,
the water near the intake

198
00:13:03,750 --> 00:13:06,960
point has turned an unusual
color, and a strange odor

199
00:13:07,040 --> 00:13:08,210
has been detected.

200
00:13:08,290 --> 00:13:10,170
Also, there appears
to be strange debris

201
00:13:10,250 --> 00:13:11,330
floating on the surface.

202
00:13:11,420 --> 00:13:13,210
[MARI] We need to get
to that island!

203
00:13:13,380 --> 00:13:15,500
The current measures are
part of an emergency

204
00:13:15,580 --> 00:13:18,040
response coordinated with
the government, so we can't

205
00:13:18,130 --> 00:13:19,540
accommodate individual trips.

206
00:13:20,750 --> 00:13:22,580
There must be a boat
heading over there.

207
00:13:22,670 --> 00:13:24,500
I'll look for someone
who can take us.

208
00:13:24,710 --> 00:13:27,330
This afternoon, Shiga
Prefecture held a press

209
00:13:27,420 --> 00:13:29,420
conference regarding Lake Biwa.

210
00:13:31,210 --> 00:13:32,040
[MARI] Please!

211
00:13:32,630 --> 00:13:34,750
What? No way.
Are you crazy?

212
00:13:35,330 --> 00:13:37,210
Just wait until the
lockdown is lifted.

213
00:13:38,170 --> 00:13:39,000
[LUCA] Please!

214
00:13:39,380 --> 00:13:43,000
Mm-mm. Nobody can take a boat
out in these conditions.

215
00:13:43,250 --> 00:13:45,420
[helicopter whirring]

216
00:13:48,080 --> 00:13:51,130
Poor visibility caused by
deteriorating water quality as

217
00:13:51,210 --> 00:13:54,080
well as strong winds predicted
to hit the area soon.

218
00:13:54,420 --> 00:13:56,080
[MARI] Nobody's
giving me a ride.

219
00:13:57,380 --> 00:13:59,210
This ban is in effect
immediately and

220
00:13:59,290 --> 00:14:01,130
will remainuntil
further notice.

221
00:14:01,290 --> 00:14:02,130
Why?

222
00:14:03,080 --> 00:14:03,920
Why?!

223
00:14:04,040 --> 00:14:05,630
[helicopter whirring]

224
00:14:13,580 --> 00:14:14,420
[gasps]

225
00:14:19,880 --> 00:14:20,710
[LUCA] Mari,

226
00:14:20,920 --> 00:14:22,330
what's going on with Lara?

227
00:14:25,380 --> 00:14:26,210
Lara,

228
00:14:27,130 --> 00:14:27,960
why?

229
00:14:28,880 --> 00:14:29,710
Why?

230
00:14:31,130 --> 00:14:32,540
Why is this happening?

231
00:14:34,710 --> 00:14:35,540
Tomorrow,

232
00:14:36,040 --> 00:14:36,880
look...

233
00:14:38,080 --> 00:14:39,420
I'm going to the police.

234
00:14:40,580 --> 00:14:42,080
There's nothing else we can do.

235
00:14:43,130 --> 00:14:43,960
We're stuck.

236
00:14:47,170 --> 00:14:50,330
[MARI] Dad! Do you know
anyone who has a boat?

237
00:15:03,460 --> 00:15:04,380
Big sis.

238
00:15:05,580 --> 00:15:07,540
[LISA] The witch's power
that put everyone

239
00:15:07,630 --> 00:15:09,250
to sleep is gradually fading.

240
00:15:10,250 --> 00:15:12,380
But even if they wake up now,

241
00:15:13,210 --> 00:15:14,210
without their light,

242
00:15:14,540 --> 00:15:16,960
they'll vanish into
foam in an instant.

243
00:15:17,880 --> 00:15:20,000
Hurry, you must give
them your light!

244
00:15:22,130 --> 00:15:22,960
[LARA] But I—

245
00:15:24,380 --> 00:15:25,540
No matter what I do,

246
00:15:26,080 --> 00:15:28,080
I'm not able to control
that power yet.

247
00:15:28,880 --> 00:15:30,040
I tried my best.

248
00:15:30,630 --> 00:15:32,380
But I wasn't able
to find true love.

249
00:15:33,250 --> 00:15:35,540
[sobbing] There's
nothing left I can do.

250
00:15:35,790 --> 00:15:37,630
[ROWAN] There is
something you can do.

251
00:15:39,420 --> 00:15:42,380
Use your blade to pierce
through the one you love.

252
00:15:43,790 --> 00:15:45,130
It's the only way.

253
00:15:46,630 --> 00:15:47,460
Huh?

254
00:15:48,210 --> 00:15:49,040
You must.

255
00:15:49,130 --> 00:15:51,830
Do not turn a blind eye
to your own heart

256
00:15:51,920 --> 00:15:53,880
when it is clear
what it desires.

257
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:55,000
But Father...

258
00:15:56,170 --> 00:15:57,000
what are you—

259
00:15:57,920 --> 00:15:58,750
[ROWAN] Lara,

260
00:15:59,500 --> 00:16:01,380
why do you think
that light of yours

261
00:16:01,460 --> 00:16:03,250
wields such a sharp blade?

262
00:16:04,500 --> 00:16:06,880
And what reason does
your light have

263
00:16:06,960 --> 00:16:09,330
to bear such ferocious fangs?

264
00:16:14,290 --> 00:16:17,500
Your heart has been betrayed
by an unrequited love and

265
00:16:17,580 --> 00:16:18,880
has become tainted.

266
00:16:20,330 --> 00:16:22,830
That is why it sought
purification through

267
00:16:22,920 --> 00:16:24,420
the blood of others.

268
00:16:25,080 --> 00:16:28,500
So your heart transformed
into a blade out of necessity.

269
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:32,040
Wandering the above world with
a hunger, seeking the blood

270
00:16:32,130 --> 00:16:34,750
and soul of your beloved
one way or another.

271
00:16:37,040 --> 00:16:39,880
If only you could obtain
what you seek, then

272
00:16:39,960 --> 00:16:42,420
will your blade become
satiated and return

273
00:16:42,500 --> 00:16:44,330
to its true form as light.

274
00:16:47,130 --> 00:16:49,750
Lara, you must cast
aside your doubts.

275
00:16:49,880 --> 00:16:52,880
The reason that blade has not
yet devoured the soul of anyone

276
00:16:52,960 --> 00:16:55,750
you hold dear is because
your heart still lacks

277
00:16:55,830 --> 00:16:59,790
the conviction to do what needs
to be done to save the lives of

278
00:16:59,880 --> 00:17:00,830
our people.

279
00:17:02,420 --> 00:17:03,250
Who is it?

280
00:17:05,880 --> 00:17:08,830
Tell me, Lara. Who is the one
you truly love?

281
00:17:09,920 --> 00:17:10,750
Tell me!

282
00:17:12,540 --> 00:17:13,380
Mari,

283
00:17:13,630 --> 00:17:14,920
what is going on?

284
00:17:15,670 --> 00:17:18,750
They told me you haven't been
to school in four days.

285
00:17:20,790 --> 00:17:21,630
Mari,

286
00:17:21,710 --> 00:17:23,250
you need to tell us what's up.

287
00:17:23,670 --> 00:17:25,080
It's about Lara, isn't it?

288
00:17:26,750 --> 00:17:28,080
You can tell us.

289
00:17:28,170 --> 00:17:30,210
We're very worried
about Lara too.

290
00:17:30,710 --> 00:17:31,750
What's going on?

291
00:17:33,830 --> 00:17:35,960
-She's at her sister's.
-Mari,

292
00:17:36,130 --> 00:17:37,670
obviously something is wrong.

293
00:17:37,750 --> 00:17:39,830
-Can't you just tell us?
-Nothing is wrong.

294
00:17:40,130 --> 00:17:42,130
[EMA] Then why are the
windows all smashed?

295
00:17:42,210 --> 00:17:44,130
Where on earth is
her older sister?

296
00:17:44,290 --> 00:17:46,790
And I haven't heard a peep
from that lady who called

297
00:17:46,880 --> 00:17:48,250
me the other day either.

298
00:17:50,830 --> 00:17:51,630
I...

299
00:17:51,710 --> 00:17:53,420
I guess she's just busy.

300
00:17:54,040 --> 00:17:54,880
Mari,

301
00:17:55,000 --> 00:17:57,000
you're not lying
to us, are you?

302
00:17:58,330 --> 00:17:59,750
What's this about a boat?

303
00:18:00,960 --> 00:18:02,830
Tell us the truth, Mari.

304
00:18:03,880 --> 00:18:06,250
Shiga prefecture established
an emergency

305
00:18:06,330 --> 00:18:07,460
response headquarters.

306
00:18:08,080 --> 00:18:09,920
[MARI] There's no way
I can tell you.

307
00:18:11,380 --> 00:18:12,670
You won't believe me.

308
00:18:13,920 --> 00:18:15,460
Yes, it's all a lie!

309
00:18:16,330 --> 00:18:19,130
That lady is Gon-chan, and
Gon-chan went out the window,

310
00:18:19,880 --> 00:18:21,460
and Lara's a mermaid!

311
00:18:30,380 --> 00:18:32,750
[MAKOTO] What did she just say?

312
00:18:43,080 --> 00:18:45,880
22ND JUNIOR BOXING TOURNAMENT
WOMEN'S CHAMPION - MARI OTSU

313
00:18:50,790 --> 00:18:52,670
[phone vibrates]

314
00:18:56,250 --> 00:18:58,790
MOBILE
LARA

315
00:19:00,710 --> 00:19:02,170
[MARI] Lara!
Lara!

316
00:19:02,790 --> 00:19:04,290
Hey, can you hear me?

317
00:19:04,670 --> 00:19:06,380
[Lara breathes heavily]

318
00:19:06,710 --> 00:19:07,540
Lara!

319
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:09,250
Mari! Mari!

320
00:19:10,080 --> 00:19:12,380
Lara, thank God!
Where are you?

321
00:19:12,630 --> 00:19:14,210
Oki Island?
Lara!

322
00:19:15,670 --> 00:19:17,420
I tried to find a
way over to you.

323
00:19:17,500 --> 00:19:18,420
Don't come here!

324
00:19:19,630 --> 00:19:21,500
Do not come anywhere
near this island!

325
00:19:21,830 --> 00:19:23,000
Lara, what's going on?

326
00:19:23,500 --> 00:19:26,210
I called because I wanted to
tell you that I won't be able

327
00:19:26,290 --> 00:19:27,500
to see you anymore!

328
00:19:28,830 --> 00:19:30,500
What are you talking
about, Lara?

329
00:19:30,580 --> 00:19:32,630
[LARA] Please,
I don't have much time,

330
00:19:33,210 --> 00:19:35,830
but I just wanted
to say thank you.

331
00:19:36,670 --> 00:19:39,830
I caused you so much trouble,
but I never meant

332
00:19:39,920 --> 00:19:41,540
-for this to happen.
-No way.

333
00:19:42,170 --> 00:19:43,460
No, no, stop it!

334
00:19:43,670 --> 00:19:44,670
Did something happen?

335
00:19:45,710 --> 00:19:47,250
Tell me what's going on, Lara!

336
00:19:47,710 --> 00:19:50,580
[LARA] Please, this might be
the last time we ever—

337
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:52,040
What the hell is going

338
00:19:52,130 --> 00:19:53,420
on with you and Gon-chan?!

339
00:19:54,380 --> 00:19:56,830
I'm coming to see you both.
You can't stop me.

340
00:19:56,960 --> 00:19:57,790
[LISA] Lara!

341
00:19:57,880 --> 00:19:59,630
You'll never see her again!

342
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:00,880
Lady Witch is

343
00:20:01,290 --> 00:20:02,420
already dead!

344
00:20:04,790 --> 00:20:06,670
[line buzzing]

345
00:20:11,750 --> 00:20:14,130
[LISA] Who was that you were
on the phone with?

346
00:20:17,960 --> 00:20:19,880
[Lara sobs]

347
00:20:22,210 --> 00:20:24,330
Listen, you have
to let them go.

348
00:20:35,170 --> 00:20:37,540
[Mari sobs]

349
00:20:42,290 --> 00:20:43,130
No...

350
00:20:43,290 --> 00:20:44,130
Lara.

351
00:20:45,000 --> 00:20:47,290
I don't care if you've
caused problems.

352
00:20:48,750 --> 00:20:50,630
I want you to stay
here forever,

353
00:20:50,710 --> 00:20:52,290
no matter what happens.

354
00:20:54,580 --> 00:20:56,380
I get lonely too, you know.

355
00:20:56,830 --> 00:20:58,210
It's not just about you.

356
00:21:01,170 --> 00:21:02,920
[birds chirping]

357
00:21:04,130 --> 00:21:08,000
SEVEN DAYS LATER
OCTOBER 4TH

358
00:21:11,250 --> 00:21:12,750
-Where are you going?
-Whoa!

359
00:21:13,210 --> 00:21:14,790
-What are you doing?
-Nothing!

360
00:21:14,880 --> 00:21:16,210
[MARI] Big bro and Luca?

361
00:21:17,630 --> 00:21:18,460
Mari!

362
00:21:18,880 --> 00:21:21,210
This guy was loitering in
front of our house.

363
00:21:21,420 --> 00:21:22,460
Explain yourself.

364
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:24,670
[♪ soft music]

365
00:21:25,250 --> 00:21:26,880
Mari, I'm sorry.

366
00:21:27,670 --> 00:21:29,750
I was being kind
of lame yesterday.

367
00:21:31,210 --> 00:21:33,630
I still don't know what to
do about it though.

368
00:21:34,000 --> 00:21:35,420
Hey, keep it down.

369
00:21:36,420 --> 00:21:39,080
[Yoshiya sighs] Okay,
whatever. So he's coming too?

370
00:21:39,710 --> 00:21:40,540
What?

371
00:21:41,830 --> 00:21:42,920
[Luca panting]

372
00:21:43,040 --> 00:21:44,790
You shouldn't skip
school like that.

373
00:21:45,210 --> 00:21:46,710
[MARI] Oh, you're one to talk.

374
00:21:47,170 --> 00:21:49,630
[YOSHIYA] It's fine if
I do it, but you're terrible

375
00:21:49,710 --> 00:21:51,130
at skipping class, Mari.

376
00:21:55,080 --> 00:21:55,920
[MARI] A boat?

377
00:21:56,290 --> 00:21:58,460
Yep, I found one.
Borrowed it from a friend.

378
00:21:58,790 --> 00:22:00,630
Don't even need
a license to drive it.

379
00:22:01,290 --> 00:22:03,290
But it's dangerous,
so I'll be there too.

380
00:22:03,580 --> 00:22:05,290
It's still dangerous
regardless!

381
00:22:05,380 --> 00:22:07,000
What's the matter?
Are you scared?

382
00:22:07,290 --> 00:22:10,500
I'm saying it's dangerous
because it's such a tiny boat!

383
00:22:10,630 --> 00:22:11,920
So? We just have to squeeze.

384
00:22:12,000 --> 00:22:13,790
[LUCA] Come on,
that's not the point!

385
00:22:14,130 --> 00:22:16,210
Oh, Mari, make sure you
wear a life jacket.

386
00:22:16,290 --> 00:22:18,290
That's not going to stop
us from capsizing.

387
00:22:18,380 --> 00:22:19,750
Please, I bet you've never--

388
00:22:19,920 --> 00:22:21,290
I've been waiting for you.

389
00:22:21,880 --> 00:22:23,080
[LUCA] It's going to sink!

390
00:22:23,170 --> 00:22:24,710
How are you already
complaining?

391
00:22:28,130 --> 00:22:28,960
[LUCA] Mari!

392
00:22:30,420 --> 00:22:32,420
[♪ closing music begins]

393
00:22:32,540 --> 00:22:35,210
TRANSLATION:
SACHIKO TAKAHASHI

394
00:22:35,420 --> 00:22:37,790
TIMING: ANDY ELLIS

395
00:22:37,920 --> 00:22:40,380
EDITING AND TYPESETTING:
ASHLEY BARBOZA

396
00:22:40,540 --> 00:22:43,080
QUALITY CONTROL:
RILEY DALTON

397
00:22:43,170 --> 00:22:45,630
TRANSLATION CHECK:
SRIRAM GURUNATHAN

398
00:23:57,580 --> 00:23:59,540
[♪ closing music ends]
